{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"X\",\n  \"regress\": \"有。X虽然更容易扫读、音乐感受也更细，但部分叙事压缩得过头，弱化了人物情绪背后的具体关系缘由，尤其S03丢失了“有人把他当作自己人”的关键细节，S13也没有完整保留“即使一直没有，也愿意自己好好过下去”的最终落点。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"X\",\n    \"point\": \"X\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"X的单列交替结构、重点词加亮和感受文字按音乐时机出现，让观众更容易在听音乐时迅速抓住叙事重点，也更容易把具体声音变化和细腻的心理感受对应起来。Y的优势是叙事交代更完整，人物为什么怀念、为什么犹豫、为什么最终选择继续生活，因果关系和情感转变交代得更充分。但综合实际观看体验，我更愿意选X：它让观众更容易一边听一边读，同时没有明显牺牲主要故事线。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "f465902c-0594-4225-a243-057c3b9381ac", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261107T073307823204Z", "elapsed_seconds": 54.563, "completed_utc": "2026-11-07T07:34:02.384795+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "06a12ce00d33ab8239667f7b7794c22ee71819dcf3bbebc5dc987c5ca614c9a8", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a